        link: "https://www.101cookbooks.com/high-summer-lunch-salad/",
        description:
          '<p>This substantial lunch salad brings together peak summer tomatoes and pluots with protein-rich mung beans and a simple vinaigrette. Fried shallots and pistachios bring the crunch, while rings of banana pepper add a bit of kick and a pop of color!</p>\n<p>Continue reading <a href="https://www.101cookbooks.com/high-summer-lunch-salad/">High Summer Lunch Salad</a> on <a href="https://www.101cookbooks.com">101 Cookbooks</a></p>',
