        title: "Quick Ricotta Dumplings in Tomato Broth",
        link: "https://www.101cookbooks.com/ricotta-dumplings/",
        description:
          '<p>A delightful bowl of quick dumplings made with potsticker wrappers filled with pesto-boosted ricotta cheese. It is ladled with a simple five-minute tomato broth for a weeknight win.</p>\n<p>Continue reading <a href="https://www.101cookbooks.com/ricotta-dumplings/">Quick Ricotta Dumplings in Tomato Broth</a> on <a href="https://www.101cookbooks.com">101 Cookbooks</a></p>',
