        title: "Spicy Chickpea Pasta Bowls",
        link: "https://www.101cookbooks.com/spicy-chickpea-pasta-bowls/",
        description:
          '<p>A colorful pasta bowl bonanza featuring a glossy, smooth chickpea harissa sauce and loads of crunchy cucumbers, cashews and fried onions. The definition of a vibrant, exciting one-bowl meal!</p>\n<p>Continue reading <a href="https://www.101cookbooks.com/spicy-chickpea-pasta-bowls/">Spicy Chickpea Pasta Bowls</a> on <a href="https://www.101cookbooks.com">101 Cookbooks</a></p>',
